+# v1.10.20 — LuCI manual button near agent status
+
+- Added a collapsible `📘 Мануал / как пользоваться ботом` block in LuCI near `Статус агента`.
+- Added clickable links for `@BotFather`, `@userinfobot`, and the GitHub project page.
+- The status poll now updates only the status text, so an opened manual block does not collapse on every auto-refresh.
+- Visible version: `Podkop Telegram Agent v1.10.20`.
+
